{# every value from a host goes through cell(): values set by users must not change the page #}
{% macro cell(value) %}{{ value | ramondevprivate.common.md_escape }}{% endmacro %}
{% set h = __fleet_inventory_page %}
---
exposure: {{ h.exposure }}
os: {{ h.os | to_json }}
last_fetched: {{ h.last_updated }}
cssclasses:
  - fleet-wide
{% if h.tags %}
tags:
{% for tag in h.tags %}
  - {{ tag }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
---
%% Generated by ramondevprivate.common.fleet_inventory. Edits are overwritten on the next run. %%

# {{ h.host }}
{% if not h.reached %}

> [!warning] Not updated since {{ h.last_updated }}
> A run targeted this host but couldn't collect it (not reachable, or a task failed). This page shows the last
> collected state.
{% endif %}
{% if fleet_inventory_descriptions_dir %}

## Description

![[{{ h.host }} description]]
{% endif %}

## System

| | |
|---|---|
| OS | {{ cell(h.os) }} |
| Kernel | {{ cell(h.kernel) }} |
| Cores | {{ h.cores }} |
| RAM | {{ h.ram }} |
| Disk | {{ h.disk }} |

### Mounts

{% if h.mounts %}
| Mount | Device | Type | Size |
|---|---|---|---:|
{% for m in h.mounts %}
| {{ cell(m.mount) }} | {{ cell(m.device) }} | {{ cell(m.fstype) }} | {{ m.size }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No mounts recorded.
{% endif %}

## Security

| | |
|---|---|
| UFW | {{ cell(h.ufw.state) }} |
| fail2ban | {{ cell(h.fail2ban) }}{{ ' (jails: ' ~ cell(h.fail2ban_jails | join(', ')) ~ ')' if h.fail2ban_jails }} |
| Auto-updates | {{ cell(h.auto_updates) }}{{ ', last successful run ' ~ cell(h.auto_updates_last) if h.auto_updates_last }} |

## Network

Exposure: **{{ cell(h.exposure) }}**{{ ' (answered: ' ~ cell(h.exposure_answered | join(', ')) ~ ')' if h.exposure_answered }}{{ ', checked ' ~ cell(h.exposure_checked) if h.exposure_checked }}

{% if h.addresses %}
| Interface | Address | Scope |
|---|---|---|
{% for a in h.addresses %}
| {{ cell(a.interface) }} | {{ cell(a.address) }}/{{ a.prefix }} | {{ 'private' if a.private else 'public' }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No addresses recorded.
{% endif %}

### Firewall

{# expressions instead of if-blocks: trim_blocks would eat the line break after a closing endif #}
UFW: **{{ cell(h.ufw.state) }}**{{ ', logging ' ~ cell(h.ufw.logging) if h.ufw.logging else '' }}{{ ', default ' ~ cell(h.ufw.defaults) if h.ufw.defaults else '' }}

{% if h.ufw.rules is none %}
{% if h.ufw.state not in ['not installed'] %}
Rules unknown (rule files not readable).
{% endif %}
{% elif h.ufw.rules %}
| To | Action | From | Comment |
|---|---|---|---|
{% for r in h.ufw.rules %}
| {{ cell(r.to) }} | {{ cell(r.action) }} | {{ cell(r.source) }} | {{ cell(r.comment) }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No rules.
{% endif %}

### Ports

{% if h.ports_unknown and not h.ports %}
Ports unknown: `ss` was not available on this host.
{% elif h.ports %}
| Port | Address | Process | Container | UFW | Bypasses UFW |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for p in h.ports %}
| {{ p.port }}/{{ cell(p.proto) }} | {{ cell(p.addresses | join(', ')) }} | {{ cell(p.processes | join(', ')) if p.processes else '—' }} | {{ cell(p.containers | join(', ')) if p.containers else '—' }} | {{ cell(p.ufw) if p.ufw else '—' }} | {{ '**yes**' if p.bypass else 'no' }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No open ports (loopback-only ports are not shown).
{% endif %}
{% if h.ports_unknown and h.ports %}

> [!note] `ss` was not available on this host: only ports published by Docker are listed.
{% endif %}

## Users

{% if h.users %}
| User | Groups | Sudo | Keys | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for u in h.users %}
| {{ cell(u.name) }} | {{ cell(u.groups | join(', ')) if u.groups else '—' }} | {{ cell(u.sudo) }} | {% if u.authorized_keys is none %}unknown (not readable){% elif u.authorized_keys %}{% for key in u.authorized_keys %}{{ '<br>' if not loop.first }}{{ cell(key) }}{% endfor %}{% else %}—{% endif %} | {{ cell(u.status) }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No users found.
{% endif %}
{% if h.keys_from_command %}

> [!note] sshd uses an AuthorizedKeysCommand: keys can also come from outside the listed files.
{% endif %}
{% if h.key_files_assumed %}

> [!note] Key file locations are assumed (sshd -T failed on this host).
{% endif %}

## Containers

{% if not h.daemons %}
No Docker daemon.
{% else %}
{% for d in h.daemons %}
- Docker {{ cell(d.label) }}: {{ cell(d.version) if d.version else 'version unknown' }}{% if d.state != 'running' %} ({{ cell(d.state) }}){% endif %}

{% endfor %}

{% if h.containers %}
| Container | Image | Version | State | Compose | Ports | Daemon |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for c in h.containers %}
| {{ cell(c.name) }} | {{ cell(c.image) }} | {{ cell(c.version) if c.version else '—' }} | {{ cell(c.state) }} | {{ cell(c.compose_dir) if c.compose_dir else '—' }} | {{ c.ports | map('ramondevprivate.common.md_escape') | join('<br>') if c.ports else '—' }} | {{ cell(c.daemon) }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No containers.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
